[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/dialogue/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n2_edwin"
text = "# DRAFT
# Edwin on the west walk at dusk (night 2). He opens on the night before: the drowned merchant (Osric carried him off),
# the merchant who left cursing the lock, or just the porter's first night. Then the knock, the pardoner, and what
# the brothers are saying: the abbot's bad dreams, and Ranulf on the incense. (The bread is night 3's talk.)
== start
-> dead [if died_merchant]
-> lived [if n1_merchant=admitted]
-> plain

== dead
(Edwin catches your sleeve the moment he sees you.)
Edwin: Did you see him? The merchant, in the fishpond? I wasn't let look.
Edwin: Brother Osric carried him off before Prime. He said a drowned man's no sight for a novice.
-> topics

== lived
Edwin: Your merchant went off this morning cursing you all the way to the gate! For locking him in!
Edwin: I've never heard a man swear like it, and I've been to Billingsgate.
-> topics

== plain
Edwin: You're alive! I mean, of course you are. How was it? Was it long?
Edwin: Brother Wulfric says the first night's the longest, and then they get longer.
-> topics

== again
Edwin: Still here? Me too. I'm meant to be in the church.
-> topics

== topics
* [if n1_knock_no_one] [if not n2_edwin_knock] Last night there was a knock at the gate, and no one there. -> knock
* [if n1_walter=admitted] [if not n2_edwin_walter] I let a pardoner in last night. -> walter
* [if not n2_edwin_talk] What are the brothers saying today? -> talk

== knock [set n2_edwin_knock]
Edwin: And nobody there? (He's gone pale, and he's trying not to be.)
Edwin: Boys from the lane. It'll have been boys. Won't it?
-> topics

== walter [set n2_edwin_walter]
Edwin: A pardoner! Did he have a feather from the Archangel's wing? They always have a feather.
Edwin: Brother Hugh says pardoners are thieves with Latin. I'd still like to see the feather.
-> topics

== talk [set n2_edwin_talk]
Edwin: That Father Abbot had bad dreams. He told the chapter this morning, and asked us all to pray for the house.
Edwin: Brother Hugh says it's the rain. Brother Ranulf says the incense isn't thick enough at Matins.
-> topics

== leave
Edwin: See you at supper! I'm reading again!
"
